WEBVTT

00:03.173 --> 00:08.726
If ya been achin' to slug this chump,
follow the sound of the bell! Right now!

00:22.169 --> 00:23.463
Yeah!

00:23.923 --> 00:26.386
We've gotta set things straight!

00:34.110 --> 00:38.201
<i>Fuuko and company went to the town
of Longing to complete a Quest.</i>

00:38.451 --> 00:41.040
<i>However, the town
had already been contaminated by Spoil,</i>

00:41.040 --> 00:43.504
<i>and was overflowing with zombified residents.</i>

00:43.838 --> 00:50.935
<i>Andy plunges in head-on, but due to Spoil's effects
his body starts to rot like the residents.</i>

00:51.352 --> 00:53.649
<i>Shen criticizes his rash behavior.</i>

00:53.899 --> 00:58.366
<i>But the Undead Andy became able
to understand the zombies' language by rotting.</i>

00:59.118 --> 01:02.792
<i>Upon finding out that one female zombie's dream
was to have a wedding,</i>

01:02.792 --> 01:05.923
<i>Andy has a wedding ceremony with her only in name.</i>

01:06.800 --> 01:12.394
<i>The satisfied zombie points at the angel statue,
wishing for the root of this tragedy to be defeated.</i>

01:12.812 --> 01:18.448
<i>That angel statue's true identity
was the target of this Quest, UMA Spoil.</i>

01:18.991 --> 01:23.626
<i>Meanwhile, Fuko headed underground chasing
after what seemed like surviving children.</i>

01:23.959 --> 01:26.381
<i>But it was already within Spoil's territory.</i>

01:26.799 --> 01:31.975
<i>As Fuko jumped out to save a child,
an eerie countdown appeared on her abdomen.</i>

01:40.492 --> 01:43.999
My name is Fuko Izumo.
What's yours?

01:44.458 --> 01:47.632
Ken. I go to the Sunflower Nursery School.

01:48.174 --> 01:51.849
Are you the oldest, Ken?
You're really responsible.

01:52.015 --> 01:55.815
Yeah, that's why I've got to protect the others.

01:58.111 --> 01:59.155
I see.

02:01.994 --> 02:05.793
We're the Union,
and we're here to help you guys.

02:05.793 --> 02:06.628
Really?

02:06.628 --> 02:07.421
Yup!

02:07.922 --> 02:09.759
But we need you to tell us...

02:10.010 --> 02:13.893
What happened here?
And why are all of you still okay?

02:16.272 --> 02:17.567
Um, well...

02:21.365 --> 02:23.495
ONE WEEK AGO

02:23.495 --> 02:26.459
AUGUST 17TH

02:42.241 --> 02:43.368
<i>That day...</i>

02:43.661 --> 02:48.336
<i>A dark ball appeared out of nowhere in
the middle of the city, and started speaking.</i>

02:50.382 --> 02:52.135
I like this place.

02:52.135 --> 02:55.016
The houses and people seem like
they're easy to spoil.

02:57.564 --> 03:01.362
But I'll start by savoring the people first.

03:04.410 --> 03:05.913
And right after it said that...

03:10.380 --> 03:13.303
<i>Numbers suddenly showed up on everyone's tummies.</i>

03:13.428 --> 03:16.309
<i>And the adults turned into zombies,
one after another.</i>

03:16.768 --> 03:17.937
Everyone, run!

03:17.937 --> 03:21.110
<i>Our teacher saw what was going on
and brought us here,</i>

03:21.110 --> 03:23.114
<i>making sure we stayed safe the entire way.</i>

03:31.088 --> 03:33.134
There's a stock of emergency rations down there, too!

03:33.134 --> 03:34.846
All of you hole up here for the time being!

03:35.514 --> 03:37.142
What about you, teacher?

03:37.392 --> 03:39.689
Don't you worry about me!

03:39.898 --> 03:44.741
Mark my words, I'm not gonna die till I find
a handsome guy to take me down the aisle!

03:47.789 --> 03:48.999
Listen up, kids!

03:49.333 --> 03:52.799
When the going gets tough,
just focus on your dreams!

03:52.799 --> 03:55.554
So long as you have a dream,
there's no way you'll ever spoil away!

03:56.055 --> 03:57.140
Off I go!

03:58.142 --> 03:58.894
Wait, teacher!

04:02.234 --> 04:04.405
Teacher!

05:40.975 --> 05:43.479
AUGUST 24TH

05:57.675 --> 06:00.472
<i>I take it they don't know where Spoil is, then.</i>

06:10.450 --> 06:11.995
I'm sorry, Mii.

06:14.291 --> 06:16.922
Oh, no! Look at Mii's numbers!

06:21.264 --> 06:26.650
What the matter, Mii?
It's okay. Help's on the way.

06:26.650 --> 06:28.486
But... but...

06:28.821 --> 06:33.872
You wanna be a florist, don'tcha?
What kinda flowers were you gonna sell
in your shop, again?

06:36.293 --> 06:37.588
Sunflowers.

06:39.008 --> 06:39.759
Oh, right!

06:40.678 --> 06:43.767
Teacher does love sunflowers, after all!

06:43.767 --> 06:44.476
Yup!

06:44.811 --> 06:46.105
That sounds great!

06:46.355 --> 06:50.155
I'll give Teacher lots
of sunflowers and surprise her!

06:56.668 --> 06:57.670
It went up!

07:00.175 --> 07:03.849
I've told you what happened
and how to raise the numbers.

07:04.391 --> 07:05.393
So...

07:06.855 --> 07:09.276
Are you really going to help us?

07:11.238 --> 07:12.157
Yeah!

07:18.921 --> 07:20.841
Seems there's something going on topside.

07:21.383 --> 07:22.595
Andy?

07:23.179 --> 07:24.557
Crimson Crescent Moon!

07:52.028 --> 07:54.283
Andy and the zombies are fighting side by side?

07:54.283 --> 07:59.459
Quite a sight to behold.
Though they don't seem to contribute much to the battle.

08:01.338 --> 08:04.136
If they're forced to live on in such a rotten state,
then at least...

08:04.512 --> 08:06.892
This must be Mr. Andy's way of being kind to them.

08:08.729 --> 08:13.196
Ayyy! You guys showed up right on time!
Take care of my bride, will ya?

08:15.491 --> 08:17.412
Ah! It's the zombie from earlier!

08:17.580 --> 08:20.878
It is, and it seems to have found
a dress as well! Great news!

08:21.212 --> 08:23.675
The wedding's not over yet!

08:28.518 --> 08:29.436
Teacher?

08:30.606 --> 08:32.150
Hey, guys, Teacher is back!

08:32.568 --> 08:34.112
Really? Seriously?

08:38.705 --> 08:40.083
You mean she is...

08:45.385 --> 08:46.888
Well, what do we got here?

08:47.180 --> 08:50.103
Looks like... the whole bunch
of ya ain't totally spoiled after all!

08:52.190 --> 08:55.029
Oh, what, that's it?
That's your price?

08:55.280 --> 08:58.202
We're gettin' hitched!

08:58.870 --> 09:03.212
Says it's her dream. Apparently,
if we tie the knot, she'll tell us where Spoil is.

09:03.547 --> 09:05.551
I'll turn her down if you consider it cheatin'.

09:07.053 --> 09:08.890
You're fine!
Take her down the aisle!

09:12.898 --> 09:16.781
My dream was to wear a wedding dress.

09:17.950 --> 09:22.668
Mark my words, I'm not gonna die till I find
a handsome guy to take me down the aisle!

09:23.127 --> 09:24.296
Off I go!

09:27.427 --> 09:28.847
Teacher!

09:29.222 --> 09:31.435
I knew you were still safe, Teacher!

09:34.274 --> 09:37.197
Your arm's hurt.
I'll bandage it for you!

09:40.662 --> 09:41.581
Huh?

09:42.374 --> 09:45.004
T-Thank...

09:46.549 --> 09:47.843
No way.

09:53.605 --> 09:54.649
Are you all right?

09:55.233 --> 09:58.824
I'm fine... but I touched that zombie just now.

10:18.279 --> 10:19.657
Well, fancy that.

10:19.991 --> 10:22.495
All right, you lugs!
We're changin' up the strategy!

10:22.997 --> 10:25.919
We're gonna hit ‘im with a li'l surprise!

10:26.170 --> 10:26.880
Listen up!

10:27.297 --> 10:29.594
See that kid over there in the red beanie?

10:30.178 --> 10:31.681
Go and touch her!

10:31.931 --> 10:32.892
Huh?

10:35.313 --> 10:38.194
Once you do,
you'll turn into bombs!

10:38.194 --> 10:41.659
That's sure to damage ‘im more
than what you've been doin' so far!

10:41.868 --> 10:46.628
W-What? Even the zombies
wouldn't want to-

11:14.057 --> 11:15.226
I understand.

11:25.079 --> 11:26.290
Teacher?

11:26.624 --> 11:27.710
What's wrong?

11:30.047 --> 11:31.174
Teacher!

11:35.182 --> 11:38.147
Teacher!

11:40.652 --> 11:43.783
It's coming... and it's a big one.

11:44.200 --> 11:45.119
My unluck!

11:48.960 --> 11:50.922
Hot damn... I knew you were the bride for me.

12:40.479 --> 12:41.733
Teacher!

12:41.733 --> 12:43.402
It's not safe. Stay back!

12:44.739 --> 12:45.866
It's pretty weak.

12:51.126 --> 12:53.046
Keep up the pressure!

12:53.380 --> 12:57.765
It's us vs. it!
Total town warfare, folks!

13:26.365 --> 13:27.660
All right! Come and get it!

13:44.401 --> 13:45.361
Wait here.

14:10.328 --> 14:13.167
Sick! Wicked sick, you guys!

14:14.419 --> 14:15.881
We should get going, too.

14:17.342 --> 14:18.052
Right.

14:29.074 --> 14:30.661
Mr. Andy, we have a problem!

14:30.661 --> 14:31.328
Wazzat?

14:33.248 --> 14:37.925
The two of us kind of ended up cursed, too.
We need to resolve this quickly.

14:37.925 --> 14:41.933
U-Um, please don't blame Mr. Shen.
I'm the one who rushed in.

14:48.195 --> 14:52.453
We don't have a choice.
We gotta skip the capture and get right to killin' it.

14:54.082 --> 14:58.382
No way! We'd fail the quest
and everyone will be furious with me!

15:08.945 --> 15:12.118
What? He's inhaling the zombies.

15:57.543 --> 16:00.841
The hell? It changed form.

16:00.841 --> 16:05.099
Mr. Andy. Have you figured out
its Rules while fighting it?

16:07.353 --> 16:08.773
More or less, yeah.

16:11.779 --> 16:16.706
Its main body can spoil any organic matter aside
from living beings at will.

16:19.377 --> 16:23.636
When it comes to spoilin' living beings,
the timer it places on them has to reach zero.

16:27.018 --> 16:28.437
His right hand is starting to spoil!

16:30.191 --> 16:32.153
Oh, no! Look at Mii's numbers!

16:32.486 --> 16:37.496
You wanna be a florist, don'tcha?
What kinda flowers were you gonna sell
in your shop, again?

16:40.002 --> 16:41.213
Sunflowers.

16:41.547 --> 16:42.841
That sounds great!

16:45.722 --> 16:46.891
It went up!

16:46.974 --> 16:51.274
I'll give Teacher lots
of sunflowers and surprise her!

16:52.235 --> 16:54.990
...or it's no dice.
That's the gist so far.

16:56.994 --> 17:02.714
Well, that restriction won't hold up...

17:04.467 --> 17:05.929
...now that it's entered its second phase!

17:17.786 --> 17:19.455
Wait, it just shot something behind itself?

17:19.455 --> 17:20.542
THANKS.
Xièxiè.

17:20.542 --> 17:22.003
NO PROBLEM
Nali nali.

17:22.255 --> 17:26.848
A total of three vessels,
so it's a Quest.

17:26.848 --> 17:30.438
Damned Apocalypse meddling in my plans.

17:31.566 --> 17:32.400
Master Shen!

17:32.693 --> 17:35.239
The structure in that laser's
trajectory has eroded away!

17:35.239 --> 17:37.703
That attack exceeded the parameters
of the “Spoil” Rule, sir!

17:37.703 --> 17:40.792
- Yawn, is it ready yet?
- You mustn't let it hit you!

17:41.126 --> 17:42.462
Well, you heard her.

17:42.880 --> 17:43.923
Here it comes.

17:47.305 --> 17:49.852
Why do you oppose me?

17:53.400 --> 17:57.534
To be born... to spoil... to return to the Earth...

17:58.369 --> 18:02.795
How can you not understand its beauty?

18:09.642 --> 18:12.898
<i>So once you touch it, you start to spoil...
no, disintegrate, eh?</i>

18:13.566 --> 18:16.113
Aah, darn it!
These gloves are made-to-order!

18:16.906 --> 18:20.329
<i>But I'm guessin' it only works
on individual parts.</i>

18:22.500 --> 18:24.755
<i>If it hits a live body,
it's an instant wrap.</i>

18:25.256 --> 18:27.260
<i>Draggin' this fight out ain't
to my advantage.</i>

18:28.178 --> 18:29.515
<i>In that case...</i>

18:29.890 --> 18:31.101
<i>Better make it quick!</i>

18:34.692 --> 18:37.948
<i>The hell?
I'm not even touchin' him yet.</i>

18:47.341 --> 18:50.389
<i>Living things spoil just by
gettin' close to it!</i>

18:52.018 --> 18:54.189
<i>This must be part of its second phase!</i>

18:55.525 --> 18:58.071
A death Negator?

18:58.907 --> 19:00.869
I admit, that is quite vexing.

19:00.869 --> 19:05.127
But given the rate of my decay in this form,
I doubt his regeneration can keep up.

19:05.837 --> 19:09.010
You two there are waiting to spoil, I see.

19:09.010 --> 19:10.847
You should be grateful.

19:13.770 --> 19:19.782
For my birth brought with it a beautiful circle of life...

19:19.990 --> 19:25.251
and you'll indulge in it while still alive!

19:32.473 --> 19:34.895
Mr. Andy! I'm going to step away
for just a second!

19:35.145 --> 19:35.981
Mr. Shen?

19:36.481 --> 19:41.701
How futile. Even if you run beyond my area
of attack, your timer will remain.

19:46.752 --> 19:51.596
The world before my birth was oh so stagnant.

19:51.596 --> 19:56.479
Everything grew uglier and uglier without decay.

19:56.479 --> 19:59.402
I brought about change in the form of spoil.

19:59.402 --> 20:07.418
And what happened? Living beings started fighting
to remain longer. They thought. They grew.

20:09.882 --> 20:12.428
It is a necessary Rule.

20:15.392 --> 20:21.071
You humans are the only beings
who reject me, branding me an evil entity.

20:21.071 --> 20:25.245
But why? All of you are a part
of nature as well.

20:27.793 --> 20:32.719
Why are you so attached to a body that won't even last
a century on its own anyway?

20:34.055 --> 20:35.809
Because we have dreams.

20:38.397 --> 20:41.486
People live with the bodies
they're born with...

20:41.486 --> 20:44.409
...and use them to pursue their dreams,
no matter the size.

20:46.914 --> 20:51.590
And I'm not going to let some
Rule you made wreck any of that!

20:51.590 --> 20:55.724
Even if my body were forced to spoil...
based solely on your whim...

20:57.351 --> 21:01.276
...as long as I have a dream...
my heart won't ever spoil away!

21:02.821 --> 21:09.668
My dream is... to become a normal girl...
and live my life to the fullest until my dying day!

21:10.419 --> 21:11.505
And until I do...

21:12.047 --> 21:14.928
...no matter what happens,
I'll never give up!

21:29.792 --> 21:30.794
The timer, it just...

21:34.050 --> 21:35.595
Sick!

21:38.726 --> 21:39.937
Andy!

21:41.439 --> 21:43.653
Wicked, to coin a phrase,
dear Fuko!

21:43.945 --> 21:46.617
Oh, and as for my dream?

21:49.540 --> 21:51.627
It's to be the greatest in all
of creation!

22:01.062 --> 22:05.989
TO BE CONTINUED

23:36.002 --> 23:36.712
PREVIEW

23:36.754 --> 23:40.887
<i>As the battle grows in ferocity,
the Undead man reaches for the Card on his forehead.</i>

23:41.387 --> 23:44.477
<i>The young man trembles in fear,
with a smile on his face.</i>

23:44.644 --> 23:48.569
<i>Next episode of Undead Unluck,
Episode 8-Victhor.</i>

23:48.778 --> 23:50.948
<i>In search of the greatest death ever.</i>
